1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,718
Meiosis then hands one chromatid to each of four gametes: two parental types, A B and a b, and two recombinants, A small b and small a B.

2
00:00:11,718 --> 00:00:19,466
The chiasma itself is the visible mark of a crossover that has already happened: Janssens' chiasmatype theory.

3
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:26,119
The chiasmata then slide to the ends in diplotene and diakinesis: terminalisation.

